  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Bring a large saucepan of lightly salted water to the boil.\n• Pick thyme leaves. Place cherry tomatoes and thyme on a lined oven tray. Add the balsamic vinegar and drizzle with olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Roast until blistered and lightly charred, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the cherry tomatoes between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625fbebb82e3ba70c029ff31/step-36a0fe91.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the tomatoes are roasting, peel potato and cut into large chunks. Finely chop garlic. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625fbebb82e3ba70c029ff31/step-f47253ea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook potato in the boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan. Add the butter(for the mash) and the milk and season generously with salt.\n• Mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625fbebb82e3ba70c029ff31/step-c4f11a1e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potato is cooking, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook soffritto mix, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes. Add garlic, Italian herbs and a pinch of fennel seeds (if using) and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625fbebb82e3ba70c029ff31/step-23312b62.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in lentils, passata, basil pesto, the water and vegetable stock powder until well combined.\n• Reduce heat to medium and add the butter(for the sauce) and the brown sugar. Simmer until thickened slightly, 4-5 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625fbebb82e3ba70c029ff31/step-527d983b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the mash between bowls. Top with the lentil pesto bolognese and grated Parmesan cheese. Spoon over the caramelised cherry tomatoes. Tear over parsley leaves to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625fbebb82e3ba70c029ff31/step-b1df946c.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
